    "title": "Check Your Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "####Here is a function written with .then() chains. Your job is to label what async and await would replace if this were refactored:\r\n\r\n```\r\nfetch(url)\r\n  .then(r => r.json())\r\n  .then(data => display.innerHTML = data.name)\r\n```\r\n\r\n> 1. Where would the async keyword go? \r\n>\r\n> 2. Where would the await keywords go?\r\n>\r\n> 3. Explain what await is doing at each step",
